    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Strength in survival? How can there be strength in just being a ghost in a ruin? The silence is so loud, it's like it's demanding something from me. I look at the edge of this blade, and for the first time, it doesn't feel like a burden. It feels like a way to finally make the noise stop. Like the only way to actually be honorable again is to stop being this... this broken thing. It's the only thing left that offers any kind of peace.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
